- (i) Exact lifting. At u = (θ + 2πj)/q, f_A(u) = h_θ(u) := Re[(1 + e^{itu})Σ_r e^{iru}z_r(θ)], with
  z_r = Σ_{y∈Y_r} e^{iyθ}.
- (ii) Bounds on h_θ: |h_θ''| <= L(θ) = Σ_r[r² + (r+t)²]|z_r(θ)|; h_θ(π/t) = 0; h_θ'(π/t) = t·Im Σ_y C_y e^{iyθ}.
